# direct.list — 公共直连（Clash: DIRECT；Shadowrocket: DIRECT）
# 格式：Surge/Shadowrocket classical（不带策略），subconverter 与 Shadowrocket RULE-SET 通用

# --- 局域网 / 内网 ---
IP-CIDR,10.0.0.0/8,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,127.0.0.0/8,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,169.254.0.0/16,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,172.16.0.0/12,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,192.168.0.0/16,no-resolve

# --- JetBrains：IDE 更新 / Marketplace 下载不走不稳定的代理路径 ---
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,jetbrains.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,jetbrains.com.cn

# --- Kiro / OpenCode 专用服务域名（PROCESS-NAME 规则只在电脑端 Script 里）---
